But note `exitCar` calls `character.spawn` and sets onFoot true during this frame before character update; fine.

`controls.reset` while on foot: respawn character next to car? Let's make it re-enter the car and reset? Existing resetPlayerCar resets player to spawn (-30), which while on foot would teleport the car but leave the character. Simpler: when on foot, R teleports the character next to the car:
```
if (onFoot) { character.spawn(player.pos, player.yaw); showBanner('RESET','BACK AT YOUR CAR','',0.8); }
```
