Camera mode on exit = 'foot'; set. But updateCamera checks onFoot first, so cameraMode irrelevant. On enter, set chase.

Sound updateEngine: `if (!silent) sound.updateEngine(onFoot ? 0 : player.speed, onFoot ? 0 : controls.throttle, onFoot ? false : player.boosting, true);` — active true with speed 0 gives a low idle engine sound; maybe active false to silence. Use `active: !onFoot`. So:
